{
 "name": "127-marker-items",
 "description": "A marker item binds a value to the field by a marker word next to the token, before or after it, with only whitespace, brackets and unit forms between. A competing word next to the token stops it. A marker word that two fields share does not compete. With a passing marker item, a label cell passes with numbers between, when each run of letters after the first number of the answer slot is in a marker word or a unit form. Rules 2, 3 and 4 of label cells stay. A competing word at the value with no marker word of the field gives MARKER_OTHER_FIELD. A field without markers decides as in spec 0.11 (spec 0.12, #540).",
